  "body": "Stylish, light-filled and full of vibrance, this beautifully presented home is all about modern, effortless living. At just three years old, it reflects current design trends with fresh interiors, contemporary finishes and a well-considered layout that makes everyday life easy.\r\n\r\nSet over two levels, the ground floor offers two lounge areas, giving you the flexibility to spread out or come together. The stylish kitchen with its generous island bench sits at the heart of the home, while a private rear patio provides the perfect spot for your morning coffee or summer evening entertaining. A handy downstairs guest toilet is another thoughtful addition.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find generously sized bedrooms, a dedicated study nook and two beautifully tiled bathrooms, including an ensuite off the main bedroom.\r\n\r\nMove in for summer and enjoy being spoiled for choice when it comes to beaches. Arkles Bay is just a three-minute drive away, and when the southerly wind picks up, beautiful Stanmore Bay is only six minutes away on the other side of the peninsula. It's one of the many advantages of coastal living here.\r\n\r\nEveryday convenience is equally impressive, with two supermarkets, the Stanmore Bay and Whangaparaoa shopping precincts, the library and Stanmore Bay Leisure Centre all within easy reach. With Penlink now well underway, you'll also be conveniently positioned near the future on-ramp, providing a more direct connection towards Albany and the North Shore.\r\n\r\nFresh, stylish and wonderfully low-maintenance, this is a home that gives you more time to get out and enjoy everything the Coast has to offer. Please note these photos are from previous listing over 2 years ago so planting etc more established. \r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/YRXZ",
